persons.note:
Dr. Bridget Sheehy — senior biologist for the Vulcan colony and Howard’s partner (Cast of Characters; Bk2). Mother of Howie with Stéphane Brodeur.

@bk3 After her death she is scanned and woken in a matrix — the first non-Bob Heaven-adjacent replication arc Howard fights the courts for (Bk3). Until that book she is biological only.

@bk4 Travels and surveys with Howard beyond Vulcan.

@bk5 Present among human guests at later moots; her name for the anti-manny movement (Luddies) is used in-world.

Colonel Butterworth of the USE Army Corps — leads the USE refuge after Sol is ruined and later the USE settlement on Vulcan (Cast of Characters; Bk1 ch26). Riker’s hard-bargaining counterpart for the first colony ships.

Not VEHEMENT. When that fringe appears he only unpacks their name for Riker and hedges it (Bk1 ch38).

@bk3 He retires on Vulcan and chooses death over a posthumous scan.
